y loud and like an annoying dog, always following his teacher. Please draw him without the flower on his eye. Both characters are close in age despite their difference in position/status.\n\nTheir Clothes may be changed but please keep the theme of chinese world / xianxia / danmei theme.\nI want to request artwork where they are shown interacting in romantic relationship. If you can draw them in an outside pavilion or with lotus flower pond I would be very happy!\n\nThank you for listening to my request! (ෆ˙ᵕ˙ෆ)♡\n\nhttps://sta.sh/216nmwkp3zew?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gumiyasaisai/works/108", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/58db99a6/uploads/origins/007c68c2-be9a-46cb-90a6-ddb87e45385d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=494ad8b2c677320106faf693bd2c17e6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/58db99a6/uploads/origins/007c68c2-be9a-46cb-90a6-ddb87e45385d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=494ad8b2c677320106faf693bd2c17e6, https://si.imgix.net/58db99a6/uploads/origins/007c68c2-be9a-46cb-90a6-ddb87e45385d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53a76db0968059adcfa1479e2f60d620 2x, https://si.imgix.net/58db99a6/uploads/origins/007c68c2-be9a-46cb-90a6-ddb87e45385d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e169b5e7d7f3b59dd54bbd556396faac 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私と友人のキャラを描いて頂きたくリクエストさせて頂きます！\n\nシイナとシズルのイラストをお願いしたいです！\n神社の神様なシズルとその生贄になる花嫁のシイナです。\n服装ポーズ背景お任せします！\n\n参考画像：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YhTF9qkWtJ2wpFOE6Qn1i8E1wQUGkFR6?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gumiyasaisai/works/107", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4616451b/uploads/origins/8022fb98-316a-4ee2-9641-5a6f1d0c6540?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0a2b0be2f0eaabcd6039d91acfa254b", "thumbnail_srcset": "